// transientYieldValveSplitRelease / case_steady_dead: the three arms that have
// no steady balance at all -- `d` (8000 in, 8000 out), `f` (8000 in, 6000 out)
// and `m` (wall in, Newtonian mid, wall out, both nodes free). Each is a supply
// wall whose ceiling `pA - 4 tau_0 L / d` = 22000 Pa sits below a drain wall
// whose floor `pB + 4 tau_0 L / d` = 28000 (d), 26000 (f), 26000 (m) Pa: no node
// pressure pays both walls, so the only steady rate any of them can report is
// zero.
//
// The transient run does not agree with that, and both answers are right. Arm `d`
// does sit still (Fd prints 27000.0 Pa in all 2001 states, and the node row is
// literally `0 = 0`), but arms `f` and `m` keep flowing to the end of the run --
// Ef at 6303.12 Pa of drive and Em at 6520.43 against their 6000 Pa threshold --
// because a march only approaches a floor, it never has to land on it. Steady
// asks for the landing point; the march reports the approach.
//
// What this file is for is the shape of the rank deficiency. With nothing to pay
// for, `0 = 0` is an EXACT solution: the banner reads `iterations=0 residual=0
// (converged)` -- Newton stops at its first look -- and the four free nodes print
// the solver's own starting value 25000 = (pA + pB) / 2, which is the midpoint
// the guess puts every one of the six yielded rows at dp 5000 Pa, inside the
// threshold each of them needs to move. A dead band is a SET of steady solutions,
// and only the march knows which element of it it parked in: it left Fd at 27000,
// Ff at 26303.12 and Fm2 at 26520.43 Pa, all above the band steady prints as one
// point.
//
// The failure is also LOCAL, which is the other half of the claim: these seven
// rows and four nodes print token for token the same here and in the seven-arm
// file (case_steady.dict) -- Sd/Ed/Sf/Ef/Sm/Em at dp 5000 Pa, Mm at 0, the four
// nodes at the guess -- so the four flowing arms do not change what the
// undetermined ones report, and read the other way it is those two arms that DO
// flow (a and z) that keep the seven-arm banner from converging, not these
// three that print nothing.
//
// verified by tests/check_transient_yield_valve_split_release.py
// (ctest verify.transientYieldValveSplitRelease).

solver
{
    type steadyNetwork;
}

fluid
{
    rho 850; mu 0.1;
}

nodes
{
    A { pressure 3.0e4; }
    B { pressure 2.0e4; }
    Fd {}; Ff {}; Fm1 {}; Fm2 {};
}

pipes
{
    Sd { from A; to Fd; length 20; diameter 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    Ed { from Fd; to B; length 20; diameter 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }

    Sf { from A; to Ff; length 20; diameter 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    Ef { from Ff; to B; length 20; diameter 0.02; yieldStress 1.5; }

    Sm { from A; to Fm1; length 20; diameter 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    Mm { from Fm1; to Fm2; length 20; diameter 0.02; }
    Em { from Fm2; to B; length 20; diameter 0.02; yieldStress 1.5; }
}

sources
{
    feed { node A; rate 6.0e-5; }
    take { node B; rate -6.0e-5; }
}

solve
{
    maxIter 200;
    tol 1e-12;
}
